        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-209, Starfish Cabinet Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou don't have to live on the beach to love the Starfish Cabinet Knob--we aren't and we think it's great. What's awesome about this cabinet pull is its versatility. Whether you choose to go the with the distressed copper finish as pictured for an old world nautical look or a more fancy star with a polished brass finish, this starfish cabinet knob will surely shine.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/3-inch-starfish-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-409\"><b>CP-409 Star Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-209 Starfish Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
